%% Every shape, a multi-line label, and a cycle (R loops back to P).
flowchart TD
    Start((Start)) --> P[Parse input]
    P --> V{Valid?}
    V -->|no| E[Report error<br/>and stop]
    V -->|yes| T[[Transform]]
    T --> W[Write output]
    T --> L[Log metrics]
    W --> R[Retry queue]
    R --> P
    L --> Done((Done))
    W --> Done
